                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is AI contract review actually reliable?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for first-pass review + issue spotting. Requires lawyer verification for final decisions. 40-70% time savings is realistic.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build custom or buy Clio / Ironclad?</h3>
                                        <p>Buy off-shelf unless you have unique workflow (specialty practice area, unusual firm structure, or you're building for the industry).</p>
                                        <h3>Which LLM for legal use?</h3>
                                        <p>GPT-4 / Claude Opus for quality-critical drafting + review. Fine-tuned models for specific document types. Never rely on models without lawyer verification for final work.</p>
                                        <h3>Data privilege concerns with LLMs?</h3>
                                        <p>Real. Use Anthropic / OpenAI / Google enterprise tiers with BAA + no-retention. On-prem for highest sensitivity.</p>
